@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Admin - Approve or Suspend Seller

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Admin|
start
note right
Precondition:
The admin is signed in.

Postcondition:
The seller status is updated and applies from the next
request, because it is read from the database.
end note
:Open the sellers;
|System|
:Display the sellers and their status;
|Admin|
:Choose to approve or suspend a seller;
:Confirm;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Admin|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the user is a seller and the status allows this action;
if (The user is not a seller, is already approved, or is suspended without being approved?) then (Yes)
  :Return the status error;
  |Admin|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
if (The user is unknown?) then (Yes)
  :Return the not-found error;
  |Admin|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Save the new status and clear the shop cache;
|Admin|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
